                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\n// pink noise in gen~\n\r\npink()\n{\n\tHistory p0(0), p1(0), p2(0);\n\twhite = noise();\n\n\tp0 = 0.99765 * p0 + 0.0990460 * white;\n\tp1 = 0.96300 * p1 + 0.2965164 * white;\n\tp2 = 0.57000 * p2 + 1.0526913 * white;\n\n\tpink = (p0 + p1 + p2 + 0.1848 * white) * 0.1; // * 0.1 = like MSP, YMMV\n\treturn clamp(pink, -1, 1);\n}\r\n\r\nout1 = pink();\r\n\r\n\r\n// see 'evi_sources.genexpr' for more\r\n",
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "<Monospaced>",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
